  ---
  📋 RECOMMENDED FIXES (In Priority Order)

  1. Create /api/auth/token endpoint OR use Better Auth's session JWT directly
  2. Consolidate API clients - remove lib/api.ts, fix lib/api-client.ts
  3. Remove unused userId parameters from API methods
  4. Fix middleware cookie names to match Better Auth config
  5. Fix health check path to /api/health
  6. Remove debug console.logs or make them development-only
  7. Add /api/auth/signout route or use Better Auth client method

  ---
  📊 FINAL VERDICT

  Frontend Status: 70% Ready

  Blockers:
  - JWT token retrieval doesn't work
  - API calls will fail without proper auth

  Non-Blockers:
  - Code quality issues
  - Performance optimizations
  - Minor bugs

  The architecture is sound but the auth integration is broken. Once the JWT flow is fixed, the frontend should work properly with the perfect backend.


